	Today I discovered (quite by accident) an extremely easy way
	to _completely_ loot any shop safely and at _no_ expense to 
	the adventurer!  Unfortunately, I died soon after of unrelated
	causes, but I can't wait to try this again.

	I've never seen anyone mention this, so I thought I would.

	** POSSIBLE SPOILER **



	I wandered into a shop trying to escape a rothe that had just
	about finished me off, but it followed me inside.  In a last
	desperate attempt to save my pathetic life, I pointed my wand
	of teleportation at the rothe, crossed my fingers and zapped.
	Not only did the rothe disappear, but so did a whole row of choice
	hardware!  At first I thought the shopkeeper would be angry, or
	would try to make me pay, but I was free to come and go as I
	pleased.  My next actions, of course, were to pile up all the
	remaining stuff and blast it all out of there to be picked up
	later ...

	Happy Hacking!

